              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kĩtoleko kya mũsalisa na kĩlonzo kya ndĩa ikĩkayan’ya, na mbalasi itũlĩlangĩte, na makasya ma kaũ kũthakanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
